{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And the lawgiver from between his feet</b> — in gematria: תלמידי חכמים (sages)." "<b>Lawgiver</b> — its numerical value רמ״ח (248), corresponding to the רמ״ח (248) limbs in a person, after the verse 'ordered in all things and kept.' יבא שילה — in gematria: משיח (Messiah)." "<b>Shiloh</b> — in gematria: משה (Moses), of whom it is written 'he gathered the heads of the people' — for then Judah was designated for sanctification, as written 'Judah's leaders rallied them.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {1 "The phrase ערוכה בכל ושמורה is a paraphrase of 2 Samuel 23:5; the verse name is not cited by the author."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:44.694631004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}